# Terraform: downloaded provider binaries and plan/plan-cache artifacts are
# machine-local and never committed. .terraform.lock.hcl IS committed (per
# root configuration -- bootstrap, envs/dev, envs/prod) and is therefore
# NOT listed here.
**/.terraform/
*.tfplan
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
